========================================================================================================================
                                     STEP-BY-STEP: CHANGING A NETWORK BRIDGE NAME
========================================================================================================================

STEP 1: Stop the active network
Command  | virsh net-destroy default
Note     | Replace "default" with your specific network name if different.

STEP 2: Open the configuration file for editing
Command  | virsh net-edit default
Action   | Locate the <bridge name='virbr0'.../> tag.
         | Change 'virbr0' to your new desired name (e.g., 'br-lan').
         | Save and close the editor.

STEP 3: Start the network to apply changes
Command  | virsh net-start default

STEP 4: Verify the bridge change on the host system
Command  | ip link show dev br-lan
========================================================================================================================
